# Environment Configuration Example
# For production deployment, consider using a backend proxy or secure environment variable management

# Weather API Configuration
VITE_WEATHER_API_KEY=your_openweathermap_api_key_here
VITE_WEATHER_CITY=Meerut

# Notes for Security:
# - Never commit API keys to version control
# - Use environment variables or backend proxies for sensitive data
# - Consider using a build tool (Vite, Webpack) to properly handle .env files
# - In production, all API calls should go through a secure backend server
